    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7816fea1dddaad88794d839",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是藏在这个面罩里……我所继承的……\n爸爸的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "188b55f17e8687487b41a8910adc4e07b6709b062b3127252b15a7c2d103f9b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
