      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d24427d12077dc025c8d8feb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰总是这个样子。\n她总是会下意识地说一些好听话\n或用夸张的动作来带给粉丝欢乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014dfb99ae12428add352fc3065a73f2a7d976d5b418bf564a02bae3730f5c83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2cd4c4e5f1a60370b08136c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在那场“宝冢纪念”中\n追过了无声铃鹿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3b5a4cc2290d768e1f41d8238e2b61d8fdd1223879348faf700eb86022246f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7807f269ae68651ee8b47aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她之所以能做到，\n应该是因为她直觉地感受到\n这才是最棒的娱乐吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98045dc6a4385b6f16d39edfee7690f8f429e706ccce34d25fe6e7387162fe8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014116.json",
